 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-idm8680448\" class=\"interactive\" data-label=\"\">\n<h2 class=\"os-title\" data-type=\"title\">\n  <span class=\"os-title-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"os-note-body\">\n<h3 data-type=\"title\" class=\"os-subtitle\">\n  <span class=\"os-subtitle-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h3>\n<span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-idm24910080\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20241024.164013/resources/1c867d40f4355beecb734e94a617b89b3f5f1f9c\" data-media-type=\"image/jpeg\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\">\n</span>\n<p id=\"fs-idp106505664\">Go to this <a href=\"https://openstaxcollege.org/l/find_the_mimic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">website</a> to view stunning examples of mimicry.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
